## Static figure

::: {#cell-static-figure .cell execution_count=3}
``` {.python .cell-code}
import matplotlib.pyplot as plt

sample_sizes = [10, 20, 50, 100, 200]
errors = [0.25, 0.16, 0.09, 0.06, 0.04]

fig, axis = plt.subplots()
axis.plot(sample_sizes, errors, marker="o")
axis.set(xscale="log", yscale="log", xlabel="samples", ylabel="absolute error")
plt.show()
```

